<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Network started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch has initiated coverage of Orion Network Systems Inc with ratings of near-term accumulate and long-term buy, the brokerage firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Tom Watts was unavailable for comment.  No other information was immediately released.</p>
<p>-- Orion shares were trading at 10-3/4, up one.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
